// are executable-embedded guest .rdata blobs handed straight to the Xenos
// program-buffer registrar by BrnRendererMemory::Construct @0x823FCA38 --
//     depth     vertex : unk_8203DAA8, 340 bytes
//     depth     pixel  : unk_8203DC00, 236 bytes
//     composite vertex : unk_8203DCF0, 400 bytes
//     composite pixel  : unk_8203DE80, 508 bytes
