// renderengine::ProgramBuffer::GetVariableHandleByName -- "gUVOffsets",
// "gUVScales", "gQuincunxOffsets" -- are exactly the three in that table.
// gOffsetXYZ/gRightUp (the Im2d transform) and gQuincunxOffsets are NOT declared
// in the PC recompile, each for a reason the .fx banner states; the per-program
